    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356150/extras/50713323ae3b91175ccd571f25e75f2f.avif?t=1715954368\" /></span><br><br>Arcane Assembly is a fantasy metroidvania where you create spells using a visual programming language. Unlock new instructions, upgrade your powers, and fight epic bosses on your journey to becoming the most powerful wizard who ever lived.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356150/extras/ec3277da73698e8b404f78e44d715625.poster.avif?t=1715954368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356150/extras/ec3277da73698e8b404f78e44d715625.webm?t=1715954368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356150/extras/ec3277da73698e8b404f78e44d715625.mp4?t=1715954368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Develop powerful spells using a visual scripting language. Hundreds of meaningfully unique spell combinations let you express yourself and your creativity through the game. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356150/extras/36e8abb9555943cf4ae628a5bac6ecb5.avif?t=1715954368\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore natural environments</h2><br>Explore remote jungle villages, treacherous lava caves, and the furthest reaches of the desert on your quest to gain magical power and knowledge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your powers</h2> <br>Unlock new instructions as you play. Each new instruction meaningfully increases the number of spells you can create.  <br>Upgrade your strength and mana to defeat stronger enemies.<br>In Arcane Assembly, knowledge is power.",
